repository-code: "https://github.com/5777-wq/OpenHull"
abstract: >-
  OpenHull is an open-source, agent-orchestrated parametric ship
  preliminary-design toolchain. From a task book (ship type, deadweight,
  service speed) it computes the weight-buoyancy balance, principal
  dimensions, hydrostatics, initial stability and trim, and the
  load-line freeboard check - every quantity validated against the
  public JBC benchmark ship and whitelisted textbook formulas.
keywords:
